{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
XRT drives the NPU through the amdxdna driver (graphics/amdxdna-kmod).

"xrt-smi validate" runs test programs from an AMD archive that is not
part of XRT.  For Strix Point and Strix Halo, as the user who runs it:

  mkdir -p ~/.local/share/xrt/2.27.0/amdxdna/bins
  fetch -o ~/.local/share/xrt/2.27.0/amdxdna/bins/ \
      https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Xilinx/VTD/main/archive/strx/xrt_smi_strx.a

Phoenix and Hawk Point use phx/xrt_smi_phx.a instead.
EOM
}
]
